# x can be any typed column on a barchart; `kind = stacked100`, a negative `ymin`.
mode: run
---- query
from '../../data/orders.csv'
| summarize revenue = sum(amount), orders = count() by customerId
| top 3 by revenue desc
| render barchart with (xcolumn = customerId, ycolumns = revenue, series = orders,
    kind = stacked100, ymin = -1.5, ymax = 3000, legend = visible)
---- expected
customerId | revenue | orders
string     | real    | long
-----------+---------+-------
c-042      | 1250.5  |      7
c-007      |  980.0  |      6
c-113      |  402.25 |      4
render: barchart x=customerId y=[revenue] series=[orders] ymin=-1.5 ymax=3000 stacking=stacked100
